 Versions
~~~~~~~~~
V1.2 By Kevin Gearing 1994
V1.3+ By Stephen Walsh 2025


 Introduction
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Zeus didn't have one of these so I thought ahhhh what the hell and decided to
write one.


 Requirements
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
* An Amiga (whaaaahayy).
* ARexx release.
* Zeus Professional BBS software.


 Distribution
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
The program is Freeware, so distribute it as you like.
Remember I will *NOT* be responsible for any damage this program does
to anything or anyone (!?!), if it nukes your hard drive, dont come running to me!
By using this program, you relieve me of all responsability.


 Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Make the following directories :-

Doors:ZBBSLister
Doors:ZBBSLister/Data

Copy all the files to Doors:ZBBSLister/


 Usage
~~~~~~

CMD_B:
	SetStatus '"In BBS Lister"'
	CallScript 'Doors:ZBBSLister/ZBBSLister'
	Signal MenuLoop


 History
~~~~~~~~

v1.0 - First ever release.
v1.1 - Removed illegal Ansi codes.
v1.2 - Removed some more illegal Ansi codes.
       Tidied up the default Ansi contained within the program.
       Edited the text to make it all more readable.
       Fixed the bug which crashed the machine while trying to save the data.
v1.3+  Added listing the telnet address and removed some not needed feeatures,
       Changed the FTN Networks listed. Made changes to the input of data.
V1.5.2 Added a feedback message to the sysop, when a new bbs is added.


